{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It appears out of nowhere. A small, insignificant thought \u2013</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/648e0eeebc9da8b0eda91fb6d3f1f8ab.gif?t=1766473741\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/648e0eeebc9da8b0eda91fb6d3f1f8ab.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1600 height=100 /></picture></span><i>\u2013 takes over for just a moment, making you doubt yourself. You immediately discard it, for it is so disgusting it makes you nauseous.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/2c762db51e4e67348988dcebbe18518c.gif?t=1766473741\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/2c762db51e4e67348988dcebbe18518c.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1600 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And yet it doesn\u2019t leave, waiting in your psyche\u2019s deepest parts, watching closely. You are your mind\u2019s master, and you won\u2019t let anything control it. But</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/fbff1d356f6c5a75fd65414cd4f8a46a.gif?t=1766473741\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/fbff1d356f6c5a75fd65414cd4f8a46a.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A safety rope from torment of anxiety and harsh reality can be found in virtual heaven, where you can forget about everything and dive into a new world hiding dozens of mysteries. You don\u2019t have to hesitate \u2013 you are a guest of honor here.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/8fcee9f5a9ca251e2293c00bfa19fda7.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/8fcee9f5a9ca251e2293c00bfa19fda7.webm?t=1766473741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/8fcee9f5a9ca251e2293c00bfa19fda7.mp4?t=1766473741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/9e87d051aa818f9a048d4b36d7761f4b.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit-Broken Identity \u2013 thriller and physiological horror visual novel with multiple endings (of course, a little romance won\u2019t hurt~).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/887d1bde0a2323b51db7758533544a22.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/f9e34178d88dc73a2c997d396bea18e1.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=841 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/b2aa448aae1bb742f33f89e19777fcbf.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=841 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/64e5362f9dbd24f63b8b10cfe6754aea.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=841 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/a284a60e886aa5409ceca17a19183d27.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=841 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/67877781db5c971a2ac1a0216b8df2ef.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=281 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions influence the story\u2019s progression and the way it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version showcases the first arc of the first episode and has 6 different endings. A full version will consist of multiple possible plot developments, each leading to its own resolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you will meet three female characters. As the narrative progresses, their stories will be revealed in more detail, and new heroes will appear, including male ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo completion time is ~25 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original sprite illustrations and\u00a0CG by AmmoliteAmy,\u00a0and BG by Saqua.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available languages</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Russian</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/0d38f8429bf7a0822786ac837d8a7019.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is suited for adults only. The list of possible trigger warnings includes, but is not limited to: horror, images and sounds that may cause anxiety or disgust, violence, weapon and blood depictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/2d7b85dd326a6af8c16e9292c0a18fa4.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1600 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrokenCorp is our small team united by AmmoliteAmy and her idea. Together we put in our effort and try to make an enjoyable game. We will greatly appreciate your support of our work!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899750?t=1766473741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/d6e2ef671d0ea6b4bf753bde8a773759dce75e8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766473741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/8e87efcea03467362dc9a55d1ee54a372296cfbf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766473741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/8e87efcea03467362dc9a55d1ee54a372296cfbf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766473741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game shows scenes of violence, consumption of alcohol and profanity. The game contains disturbing images and sounds with blood and guns."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It appears out of nowhere. A small, insignificant thought \u2013</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/648e0eeebc9da8b0eda91fb6d3f1f8ab.gif?t=1766473741\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/648e0eeebc9da8b0eda91fb6d3f1f8ab.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1600 height=100 /></picture></span><i>\u2013 takes over for just a moment, making you doubt yourself. You immediately discard it, for it is so disgusting it makes you nauseous.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/2c762db51e4e67348988dcebbe18518c.gif?t=1766473741\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/2c762db51e4e67348988dcebbe18518c.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1600 height=100 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And yet it doesn\u2019t leave, waiting in your psyche\u2019s deepest parts, watching closely. You are your mind\u2019s master, and you won\u2019t let anything control it. But</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/fbff1d356f6c5a75fd65414cd4f8a46a.gif?t=1766473741\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/fbff1d356f6c5a75fd65414cd4f8a46a.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A safety rope from torment of anxiety and harsh reality can be found in virtual heaven, where you can forget about everything and dive into a new world hiding dozens of mysteries. You don\u2019t have to hesitate \u2013 you are a guest of honor here.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899750/extras/8fcee9f5a9ca251e2293c00bfa19fda7.poster.avif?t=1766473741\" width=1000 height=562 ><sourc